          <p style="font-size: 0.8rem; color: #b45309; background: #fffbeb; border: 1px solid #fde68a; border-radius: 6px; padding: 8px 10px; margin-top: 8px;"><i class="fas fa-triangle-exclamation"></i> Your homepage has <strong>no ticker block</strong> yet — click <strong>Blocks</strong> tab and add a "Headlines Ticker Marquee" block for this style to appear on the site.</p>
